            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold">$19</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">one-time · up to 3 personal computers</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Ideal for individuals switching monitors between a home desk, living room KVM TV, and office or travel setup.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm mb-8">
              <li>✓ Activate on up to <strong>3 personal machines</strong> (Mac, Windows, or Linux)</li>
              <li>✓ Unlimited rooms, monitor histories &amp; 1-click role presets</li>
              <li>✓ Includes signed <code>ScreenStage.app</code>, <code>ScreenStage.exe</code> &amp; Linux binaries</li>
              <li>✓ Automatic software updates &amp; built-in diagnostic support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            onclick="window.openDisplaysCheckout && window.openDisplaysCheckout('personal')"
            class="block w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-emerald-400 text-slate-950 text-center font-extrabold text-sm hover:opacity-95 transition cursor-pointer shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20"
